Let $\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\mathbf{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}.$  Then the projection of $\mathbf{v}$ onto $\mathbf{w}$ is given by
\begin{align*} \text{proj}_{\mathbf{w}} \mathbf{v} &= \frac{\mathbf{v} \cdot \mathbf{w}}{\|\mathbf{w}\|^2} \mathbf{w} \\ &= \frac{\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}}{\left\| \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \right\|^2} \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \\ &= \frac{(1)(8) + (-2)(1)}{8^2 + 1^2} \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \\ &= \frac{8 - 2}{64 + 1} \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \\ &= \frac{6}{65} \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \\ &= \begin{pmatrix} 48/65 \\ 6/65 \end{pmatrix}. \end{align*}

Final Answer: The final answer is $\boxed{\begin{pmatrix} 48/65 \\ 6/65 \end{pmatrix}}$

